msgid "Work with me in NibWP Agent View on %s. Call nibwp/studio-listen and handle each request it returns: use your NibWP tools to do the work, post progress and your answer with nibwp/studio-reply (navigate or reload so I see the result), and ask me with nibwp/studio-ask when you need a decision. After each reply, call nibwp/studio-listen again, and keep going until it returns stop. Quiet stretches are normal: keep listening without stopping or asking me whether to continue; Agent View checks in with me and tells you when to rest."
